      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's an interesting take. can you expand on that? specifically, why would communal living and religious practices translate to higher risk? i'm trying to understand if this level of 'volatility' is just about the schedule or if there's an underlying implication about the social stability of that environment compared to a more individualistic one.",
